  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 44002611200
    m_Localized: You found my sister Azula! Thank you adventurer!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80543387648
    m_Localized: Oh... I see, she didn't want to return from her adventure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108536172544
    m_Localized: 'Well, that is to be expected from her. She was always the most
      diligent adventurer. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144032567296
    m_Localized: "The important thing is that she is safe and sound. I am sure she
      will return whenever she feels done with her investigations. \n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
